# React Patterns

## Components

- Functional components only
- Named exports for feature components, default via TanStack Route export
- Colocate page logic in route files; extract reusable parts to `src/components/`

## Routing (TanStack Router)

- Pages in `src/routes/` — file-based routing
- Authenticated pages under `src/routes/_authenticated/`
- Dynamic segments: `$paramName` (e.g. `$gardenId`)
- Use `createFileRoute` with `head()` for meta tags
- Use `Link` from `@tanstack/react-router`, not `<a>` for internal nav
- Auth guard: `_authenticated/route.tsx` beforeLoad

## Data Fetching

```tsx
// Read data
const { gardens, logs, isLoading } = useFarmStore();

// Mutations
const actions = useFarmActions();
await actions.addGarden({ ... });
```

- React Query for server state — do not fetch in useEffect
- Invalidate query keys after mutations
- Server functions via `useServerFn(fn)` from `@tanstack/react-start`

## Forms

- Simple forms: controlled `useState`
- Complex forms: react-hook-form + zod
- Submit handlers: async with try/catch + toast feedback
- Validate before submit with user-friendly Vietnamese errors

## Composition

```
Route file → Feature components → shadcn/ui primitives
```

Check existing components before creating new ones. Examples:
- `DashboardAI`, `WeatherCard`, `TodayTasks`, `AppSidebar`

## Do Not

- Add global state libraries (Redux, Zustand)
- Create `src/pages/` directory (TanStack uses `src/routes/`)
- Call AI APIs in useEffect without user interaction
- Use class components
